Cell["\<\
Under this non-viscous limit, we assume vanishing shear and bulk viscosity, \
\[Eta](r)=\[Zeta](r)=0. Also we are working with L=2.\
\>", "Text",
 CellChangeTimes->{{3.965047054275556*^9, 3.965047151701168*^9}, {
  3.965047840987996*^9, 
